// JIT Access Bot — welcome handler, shown when someone first opens the bot.
return {"text":"Hi " + ifnull(user.get("first_name"), "there") + "! I give people temporary access to Cliq channels.\n\n• *Need access?* Paste a channel link here, say how long and why. A channel admin approves, and I remove the access automatically when it ends.\n• *Channel admin?* Send *enrol #channel* to allow requests for a channel you run.\n• *Approver?* Send *connect* once so I can add and remove members as you.\n\nSend *help* any time.","card":{"title":"JIT Access Bot","theme":"modern-inline"}};
